          "settings": {
            "question": "How thick should a residential driveway be?",
            "answer": "<p>Four inches over a compacted base handles normal car and truck traffic. We pour thicker and add reinforcement at the approach, the apron and anywhere heavy vehicles turn or park — we'll spec it during the estimate.</p>"
